        <mxCell id="header-sub" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#e2e8f0&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;One row per identity, one column per resource by access plane. A cell shows the level after the plan, and what the plan changed to get there.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;Read a row: everything an identity can do. Read a column: who can touch a resource. A workload column touched by another project&amp;#39;s identity is a leak.&lt;br&gt;Not verified: the policy of the CMP&amp;#39;s Vault token (G15, drawn as the root token), the scope of its Cloudflare token (G16), the members&amp;#39; GitHub base permission (G17, main is unprotected: checked) and who holds Cloudflare super admin, drawn as the platform admin.&lt;br&gt;Plan phases: P1 root accounts and audit trail, P2 CMP rights, P3 tenant isolation and GitOps protection, P4 cloud accounts.&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=11;fontColor=#94a3b8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
